    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧪 1. Fault Scenario Ingestion\n- `Manual_Trigger`: Starts manual fault-testing suite.\n- `Code_SimulateScenarios`: Injects 4 diverse API scenarios:\n  - `200 OK` (Success)\n  - `404 Not Found` (Client Error)\n  - `429 Too Many Requests` (Rate Limit)\n  - `503 Service Unavailable` (Server Outage)",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e8a10001-0013-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Sticky_Scenario_Ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ 2. Primary Gateway & Fault Isolation\n- `HTTP_PrimaryGateway`: Calls `https://httpbin.org/status/{code}`.\n- **Continue On Fail: ON** (Never Error: ON): Traps 4xx/5xx errors into `$json.error` without aborting execution.\n- `Code_ClassifyResponse`: Evaluates status code into taxonomy categories (`SUCCESS`, `NOT_FOUND`, `RATE_LIMITED`, `SERVER_FAULT`).",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e8a10001-0014-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Sticky_Fault_Isolation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔀 3. Error Taxonomy Switch & Specialized Paths\n- `Switch_ErrorTaxonomy`: Evaluates `statusCode`:\n  - **Output 0 (200):** Normal processing via `Code_LogSuccess`\n  - **Output 1 (404):** Non-terminating quarantine via `Code_LogMissingResource`\n  - **Output 2 (429):** Dynamic backoff delay (2s) ➔ `HTTP_Retry429`\n  - **Output 3 (503):** Immediate failover dispatch to secondary backup provider",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e8a10001-0015-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Sticky_Taxonomy_Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 4. Resilience Telemetry Convergence\n- `Code_ConsolidatedMetrics`: Converges all 4 branches.\n- Confirms 100% resilience recovery score with zero unhandled exceptions.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e8a10001-0016-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Sticky_Metrics_Convergence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
